  "system": {
    "description": {
      "gm": "",
      "value": "<p class=\"MsoNormal\">You’ve learned how to best hide your runic magic, to make sure you aren’t caught using it. You gain the @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.feats-srd.9o2VSlMQVPB4LN09]{Bizarre Magic} skill feat, even if you do not meet its prerequisites. Any time you use a runic spell or a runeword, a creature must first either recognize your empowered spell or Identify your runeword action to be able to tell that you are using runic magic. This also applies to when you use Fragmentary Runes, if you have those feats.</p>"
